{"duration": 27.44, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 8.18, "text": "Over the following days, carcasses lay on\nthe seabed. More washed up in April 2016,"}, {"start": 8.18, "end": 15.36, "text": "and marine biologist Alison Kock examined\nfive of them. Each one had a torn chest"}, {"start": 15.36, "end": 22.76, "text": "and no liver. Orca teeth had left marks\non the skin. Her work gave the first proof"}, {"start": 22.76, "end": 27.44, "text": "that orcas on this coast were\nkilling sharks for a single organ."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.3, "text": "Over"}, {"start": 0.3, "end": 0.52, "text": "the"}, {"start": 0.52, "end": 0.9, "text": "following"}, {"start": 0.9, "end": 1.6, "text": "days,"}, {"start": 2.14, "end": 2.56, "text": "carcasses"}, {"start": 2.56, "end": 3.02, "text": "lay"}, {"start": 3.02, "end": 3.4, "text": "on"}, {"start": 3.4, "end": 3.58, "text": "the"}, {"start": 3.58, "end": 4.12, "text": "seabed."}, {"start": 4.7, "end": 5.0, "text": "More"}, {"start": 5.0, "end": 5.36, "text": "washed"}, {"start": 5.36, "end": 5.74, "text": "up"}, {"start": 5.74, "end": 6.14, "text": "in"}, {"start": 6.14, "end": 6.52, "text": "April"}, {"start": 6.52, "end": 7.52, "text": "2016,"}, {"start": 8.18, "end": 8.28, "text": "and"}, {"start": 8.28, "end": 8.62, "text": "marine"}, {"start": 8.62, "end": 9.42, "text": "biologist"}, {"start": 9.42, "end": 10.07, "text": "Alison"}, {"start": 10.07, "end": 10.72, "text": "Kock"}, {"start": 10.72, "end": 11.8, "text": "examined"}, {"start": 11.8, "end": 12.42, "text": "five"}, {"start": 12.42, "end": 12.66, "text": "of"}, {"start": 12.66, "end": 13.18, "text": "them."}, {"start": 13.66, "end": 13.92, "text": "Each"}, {"start": 13.92, "end": 14.24, "text": "one"}, {"start": 14.24, "end": 14.46, "text": "had"}, {"start": 14.46, "end": 14.62, "text": "a"}, {"start": 14.62, "end": 14.88, "text": "torn"}, {"start": 14.88, "end": 15.36, "text": "chest"}, {"start": 15.36, "end": 15.88, "text": "and"}, {"start": 15.88, "end